Lastbook: licence to be decided

No licence has been chosen for Lastbook's own code and content yet. Until one is added here, all rights are reserved
by the Lastbook project, and this repository is private.

Third-party software, models and library content keep their own licences: see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the Sources
and permissions page in each library pack.

A note for choosing the licence: the apps bundle python-libzim (GPL-3.0-or-later) and libzim (GPL-2.0, per upstream), so
the apps as distributed must meet the GPL's terms. That affects which licences fit the project as a whole.
